  "encounters": [
    {
      "id": "mdw-traveler",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 1250,
      "speaker": "Traveler",
      "lines": [
        "You there — small one. Alone on this road?",
        "A family passed through two days back. Worn out, asking after a child. They pressed on east, toward the pass.",
        "It's a hard road ahead. What will you do?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Press on after them",
        "Ask what else they said"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Then walk fast and rest when you must. East, always east.",
        "Only that they'd wait where they could. Look for signs at the waysides — cairns, shrines. Travelers leave word there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-relic-1",
      "type": "interest",
      "x": 2450
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-hungry-boy",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 3000,
      "speaker": "Thin Boy",
      "lines": [
        "Have you food? Any at all.",
        "Ma went east for work in the spring. She hasn't come back for me."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Share what you carry",
        "You'll manage. So will I."
      ],
      "responses": [
        "He eats without looking up. When he finishes he presses a chipped copper into your hand — his whole fortune, and he will not take it back.",
        "He nods like he expected it. That is the part that stays with you."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "gold": -8,
          "mark": {
            "kindness": 1
          }
        },
        {}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-fallen-tree",
      "type": "challenge",
      "kind": "push",
      "x": 4150
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-relic-2",
      "type": "interest",
      "x": 5250
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-relic-3",
      "type": "interest",
      "x": 5650
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-rite",
      "type": "rite",
      "x": 7250,
      "speaker": "Elder",
      "lines": [
        "So the road brought you here, little one. Rest — the village is safe.",
        "Travelers spoke of your family. East, past the pass. You'll need more than luck to follow.",
        "It is time for your Rite of Passage. What are your hands made for?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        "The knife and the shadow",
        "The word and the will",
        "The blade and the shield"
      ],
      "classIds": [
        "thief",
        "wizard",
        "fighter"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Quick and quiet, then. Keep your knives close and your feet closer.",
        "The will bends the world, in time. Start with a spark.",
        "Strong hands. Swing wide, stand fast — but the sky will never fear you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mdw-mira",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 8200,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "lines": [
        "You walk like someone chasing, not wandering.",
        "I'm looking for my brother. Two winters now. Every road east, every wayside stone.",
        "The roads are worse than they were. Things run in packs now that used to run alone. Two of us stand a better chance than one of us."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Walk with me",
        "I go faster alone"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "She falls in a half-step behind and to your left, where she can see the road and you both.",
        "She doesn't argue. She only says: you'll want someone at your back before the pass. Then she is gone."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "companion": "mira",
          "mark": {
            "mira_offer": "taken"
          }
        },
        {
          "mark": {
            "mira_offer": "refused"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
